    "millsfield:images_texts": [
      "Greeting\nThis calendar has been designed to be helpful to you\nthroughout 1941. We hope that it also will remind\nyou of American Airlines whenever you travel.\nAMERICAN AIRLINES, 1%\nTHESE ILLUSTRATIONS\nThese illustrations are reproductions of\nnatural-color Kodachrome photographs by\nTean Britai\nespecially for American Airlines' 1941 calendar\nsend by seng his cat, toget\ncate by suming month\nTran bruits\nGREETINGS FROM ALL OF US\nAMERICAN AIRLINES\n\u003e INC.\n1940\nSun\nMon\nTue\n3\nIO\n15\nI6\n17\n22\n23\n24\n29\n30\nDecember\nWed\nThu 1\n4\nFri\nSat\n6\nII\nI2\n13\n18\n20\n2I\n25\n26\n27\n28\n*\n*\n1940\nNOVEMBER I940\nMon\n3\nIO\n17\n24\n4\nII\n18\n25\n5\nI2\n19\n26\n6\n13\n20\n27\n7\n14\n2I\n28\n8\n15\n22\n29\n2\n9\nI6\n23\n3°\nSun\nJANUARY\nMon\nTue\nWed\nI94I\n3\n12\nI9\n26\n6\n13\n20\n27\n7\n14\n2I\n28\n8\n15\n22\n29\n2\n9\nI6\n23\n17\n24\n4\nII\n18\n25",
